---
/**
 * VaulttWorld: Vaultt's world on the homepage, a fixed theme layer (it goes inside `.themes`, after Atlas's layer and
 * before `.theme--ep`): vaultt.io navy with the living network on a canvas, the whole screen. It does not move: it
 * fades in over Atlas's world as Vaultt's intro arrives, and Endless Pursuit's fades in over it once the jobs have
 * unfolded (src/scripts/backdrops.ts). vaultt-home.ts drives the canvas. No props.
 */
---
<div class="theme theme--vaultt" aria-hidden="true">
  <canvas class="vx-world" data-vx-net data-look="world" data-managed="1"></canvas>
</div>
